    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so im 34 weeks pregnant and i've been feeling super exhausted lately. also my hands and face look kinda puffy/swollen today and i keep seeing these little little flashes of light when i blink... i'm assuming it's just cuz im carrying so much extra weight now lol. is that normal?",
