      "content": "wait really?? u think it's that serious? i honestly just thought i was dehydrated or something cause im always thirsty lately. my husband thinks i should just take some extra water and sleep it off. if i just monitor it for a few hours, do u think it'll pass? i'm really not trying to go to the ER if it's just swelling",
