      "content": "idk i'm just so scared of hospitals and the costs tbh... my sister had something like this last time and her doctor told her to just take some magnesium and rest. do u think i could try some magnesium or maybe some ibuprofen to help the swelling instead of going to the hospital? i really dont want to go if i dont have to.",
